This licence covers the code, manuscript and figures in this repository.

It does NOT cover the three corpora, which are not redistributed here and
carry their own terms:

  WESAD                 Schmidt et al. 2018, UCI ML Repository ID 465.
                        Non-commercial research use; see the dataset's own
                        terms of use.
  Wearable Exam Stress  Amin, Wickramasuriya & Faghih 2022, PhysioNet.
                        Open Data Commons Attribution License v1.0.
  Nurse Stress          Hosseini et al. 2022, Scientific Data.
                        See the dataset record for terms.

Obtain each from its primary repository. data/DATASETS.md records the exact
source URLs, download dates and byte counts used here.
